      "writtenOn": "2017-10-13T17:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might be worth considering a simpler solution where you split the minSdkVersion - maxSdkVersion range into two, based on API Level 28 (P). For minSdkVersion - min(P, maxSdkVersion), you ignore the case if the range is empty, if not, you invoke the old version of this method and exit early if it returns no supported sigs. Then, for P - maxSdkVersion, you ignore the case if the range is empty, if not, you invoke a new method designed for P+, and exit early if it returns no supported sigs. If there are supported sigs for both ranges, combine the two sets and return.",
      "revId": "5b61bd2f5427a20c88128bcc452d838ef49ebf99",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
